#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
download_ability_icons.py
--------------------------
Downloads every Valorant agent icon and agent-ability icon from the free
community API at valorant-api.com, straight into your Anti-Strat Vault
repo folder, using the same naming convention the app already uses for
agent icons.

HOW TO RUN
1. Put this file directly inside your repo folder, i.e.
   ~/Documents/GitHub/anti-strat-vault/download_ability_icons.py
2. Open a terminal / command prompt there (or just double-click it if
   .py files are associated with Python on your machine).
3. Run:  python3 download_ability_icons.py
   (On Windows, "python download_ability_icons.py" also works.)

WHAT IT CREATES
  Agents/<AgentName>.png              (skipped if it already exists)
  Abilities/<AgentName>/Q.png
  Abilities/<AgentName>/E.png
  Abilities/<AgentName>/C.png
  Abilities/<AgentName>/X.png
  Abilities/<AgentName>/P.png         (only for the couple of agents with
                                        a distinct passive icon, e.g. Jett)

No third-party packages needed -- only the Python standard library, so
this should run as-is on a stock Python 3 install.
"""

